WEBVTT

01:17.703 --> 01:18.704
Father.

01:20.205 --> 01:22.291
A momentous day.

01:23.166 --> 01:24.168
Yes.

01:29.089 --> 01:30.215
Won't you eat?

01:31.633 --> 01:33.093
I'll watch.

02:19.389 --> 02:20.891
We're seeing to Mr. Bailiff.

02:31.485 --> 02:33.487
I wish you'd take them raw.

04:57.631 --> 04:58.924
Unveil.

05:01.343 --> 05:03.053
Eustice Huang.

05:04.263 --> 05:08.350
Today marks the end
of your Wintertide Fellowship.

05:10.561 --> 05:12.229
Congratulations.

05:14.773 --> 05:17.316
Your bed will be moved
from your parents' home

05:17.317 --> 05:21.572
to the Gunnel Eagan Empathy Center
in Svalbard,

05:22.155 --> 05:25.367
where you will work
to steward global reforms.

05:26.910 --> 05:29.496
I thought
I'd be finishing the quarter.

05:30.914 --> 05:34.042
Empathy awaits, fellow Huang.

05:35.752 --> 05:38.338
You may resume your duties for the day.

05:38.839 --> 05:40.841
A shuttle will pick you up at dusk.

05:43.427 --> 05:44.720
But first...

05:46.889 --> 05:48.807
lay the game on the table.

05:55.230 --> 06:00.444
The handbook requires that you mark
this betterment with a material sacrifice.

06:02.446 --> 06:05.616
I have chosen your ring toss game
as a proper totem.

06:36.897 --> 06:37.981
Again.

06:43.195 --> 06:44.446
Again.

06:55.791 --> 06:57.583
Asher picked up the kids.

06:57.584 --> 06:58.836
Outstanding.

07:11.139 --> 07:12.724
I kissed your innie.

07:15.060 --> 07:16.186
Beg pardon?

07:19.857 --> 07:21.566
I saw your innie again at Lumon.

07:21.567 --> 07:24.194
And right before I left,

07:25.362 --> 07:29.491
we ended up kissing for about a minute.

07:40.919 --> 07:41.753
What?

07:42.796 --> 07:44.298
I'm sorry.

07:49.803 --> 07:50.846
How?

07:52.139 --> 07:53.473
What the fuck? Like...

07:54.224 --> 07:55.600
It didn't f--

07:55.601 --> 07:57.018
It didn't what?

07:57.019 --> 07:59.688
It didn't mean anything?

08:00.272 --> 08:02.107
I wasn't going to say that.

08:04.776 --> 08:05.860
Wow.

08:05.861 --> 08:06.945
Yeah.

08:07.613 --> 08:09.363
You've been adrift.

08:09.364 --> 08:10.407
You know that.

08:11.491 --> 08:15.953
This is so many
fucking dimensions of fucked.

08:15.954 --> 08:16.913
He just...

08:16.914 --> 08:19.248
He reminds me of how you used to be.

08:19.249 --> 08:20.374
- Okay.
- Dylan?

08:20.375 --> 08:24.671
I'm gonna go to work and earn
a paycheck to feed our children.

08:25.297 --> 08:27.298
- Will you st--
- And I'm gonna respectfully request

08:27.299 --> 08:28.633
that you don't follow me there

08:28.634 --> 08:30.968
and use my own body
to fucking cheat on me.

08:30.969 --> 08:32.260
- Don't leave.
- You know what?

08:32.261 --> 08:36.057
Since I would have no way of
knowing if that's happening or not...

08:36.058 --> 08:37.767
I don't know. Maybe I just go quit.

08:37.768 --> 08:41.019
Maybe I go in and I quit
and I just end his existence.

08:41.020 --> 08:42.272
How about that?

09:20.686 --> 09:21.728
Burt.

09:28.944 --> 09:32.573
"They may be also connected

09:33.282 --> 09:38.954
to several recent
disappearances or deaths.

09:39.746 --> 09:44.667
Goodman may have participated

09:44.668 --> 09:50.841
as a low-level Lumon enforcer or goon."

09:52.551 --> 09:56.638
"Lumon goon." That stings.

10:00.934 --> 10:03.103
We never used words like that.

10:08.317 --> 10:13.405
With Lumon it's very specific language.

10:17.826 --> 10:19.745
That was before. I...

10:20.537 --> 10:23.540
I know now that I was wrong.

10:24.708 --> 10:26.960
I know you're not with them.

10:33.759 --> 10:35.802
Would you go for a ride with me?

10:39.097 --> 10:41.850
Burt, I'm sorry. I...

10:52.861 --> 10:55.364
Go for a ride with me.

11:28.856 --> 11:29.814
Yes?

11:29.815 --> 11:31.691
- It's nine o'clock.
- And?

11:31.692 --> 11:33.944
The numbers aren't moving.

11:35.362 --> 11:36.737
The numbers aren't moving.

11:36.738 --> 11:39.115
He may just be running late.

11:39.116 --> 11:42.326
The final quota was promised today.

11:42.327 --> 11:43.996
Get him here now.

12:01.722 --> 12:02.723
Hello?

12:04.600 --> 12:05.684
Mark?

12:13.859 --> 12:16.235
- Do you know where you are?
- I'm fine.

12:16.236 --> 12:17.654
All right. Where are you?

12:19.573 --> 12:21.282
Smelly fucking car.

12:21.283 --> 12:23.035
That's nice.

12:24.411 --> 12:26.747
And how about me?
Am I me or a copy machine?

12:28.707 --> 12:30.417
Tragically, you're you.

12:41.261 --> 12:42.721
This is a mistake.

12:43.805 --> 12:45.431
I'm sorry. The wind was whistling

12:45.432 --> 12:48.059
over the hole in the back of your skull,
so I didn't quite get that.

12:48.060 --> 12:50.437
Did you just call my plan
a fucking mistake?

12:53.357 --> 12:54.690
We told her everything.

12:54.691 --> 12:56.526
She told us shit.

12:56.527 --> 12:57.860
We can't trust her.

12:57.861 --> 12:58.904
Yeah.

13:01.448 --> 13:02.741
This is it.

13:30.561 --> 13:32.688
Looks like she's not here yet.

13:41.947 --> 13:43.948
I mean, what if it's a trap?

13:43.949 --> 13:46.075
Maybe it is, I don't know. Maybe it's not.

13:46.076 --> 13:47.703
But we fucking need her.

13:58.964 --> 14:00.007
Don't answer it.

14:14.396 --> 14:16.063
- Where's Mark?
- Excuse me?

14:16.064 --> 14:18.609
This is the second day in a row
he's not here. Is he coming in?

14:20.235 --> 14:22.279
Nondisclosure policy forbids.

14:23.739 --> 14:26.033
He had a nosebleed before.

14:27.075 --> 14:28.326
Is he okay?

14:28.327 --> 14:31.663
Why?

14:33.540 --> 14:34.957
He's Department Chief.

14:34.958 --> 14:37.669
Dylan is. In Mark's absence.

14:38.962 --> 14:40.547
Kinda like you and Cobel.

14:41.673 --> 14:43.091
Replace one part with another.

14:46.261 --> 14:47.763
That's enough, Helly R.

14:54.728 --> 14:56.146
Don't you mean Helly E?

14:59.650 --> 15:01.776
Helena Eagan is my employer.

15:01.777 --> 15:06.698
You are my subordinate and this
behavior constitutes insubordination.

15:09.576 --> 15:10.953
Yeah, no shit.

15:16.333 --> 15:17.668
Leave it open.

15:33.141 --> 15:35.310
I told you about us.

15:39.773 --> 15:40.774
What?

15:42.484 --> 15:45.945
I told my husband

15:45.946 --> 15:49.533
about you and me this morning.

15:55.414 --> 15:56.874
Was he glad for us?

15:58.917 --> 16:00.002
No.

16:03.547 --> 16:07.801
Well, he should be because I'm...
I'm making you happy.

16:09.011 --> 16:10.053
I know.

16:10.721 --> 16:11.972
And he's not.

16:14.224 --> 16:16.351
I can't see you anymore.

16:19.146 --> 16:21.230
He threatened to quit.

16:21.231 --> 16:23.524
And I don't know if he's still going to.

16:23.525 --> 16:26.277
But maybe if I tell him
that this is over--

16:26.278 --> 16:29.906
- No. Hold on.
- This is all my fault.

16:29.907 --> 16:32.659
- I never should have come here.
- Wait.

16:33.160 --> 16:37.413
Gretchen, my life started
when you came here.

16:37.414 --> 16:39.582
That's not true.

16:39.583 --> 16:41.876
You have so much going for you.

16:41.877 --> 16:44.003
No, I have nothing else.

16:44.004 --> 16:48.717
I have this and
I have fucking pencil erasers.

16:49.885 --> 16:51.511
I'm sorry, I have to go.

16:51.512 --> 16:52.930
No, wait, wait.

16:57.100 --> 16:57.975
Gretchen G--

16:57.976 --> 17:01.729
- Oh, my God.
- I love you.

17:01.730 --> 17:05.317
And I know I'm just an innie,
but I love you all the way, I do.

17:06.902 --> 17:08.153
Gretchen...

17:10.196 --> 17:11.113
I made this for you.

17:11.114 --> 17:12.782
I can give you a life. Please.

17:29.716 --> 17:31.218
I'm so sorry.

17:34.096 --> 17:35.097
Gretchen.

17:36.932 --> 17:38.642
Gretchen!

18:11.925 --> 18:13.427
You should keep it.

18:15.095 --> 18:17.264
Give it to someone you meet down here.

18:18.140 --> 18:22.144
It's just O&D and the goat people.

18:23.896 --> 18:25.439
That we know of.

18:28.650 --> 18:30.110
She's my wife.

18:31.069 --> 18:34.990
She's not your wife...

18:38.243 --> 18:41.538
Because no one would treat someone
they love the way she's treating you.

18:42.706 --> 18:44.123
Like all the outies treat us.

18:44.124 --> 18:45.833
Like everything's for them.

18:45.834 --> 18:48.879
Okay, well,
what the fuck is there to do about it?

18:49.796 --> 18:54.009
At the end of the day, we're still stuck
down here, with no lives and no family.

18:55.552 --> 18:57.095
Irving was your family.

18:57.846 --> 19:00.307
- Dude.
- And he left you a message.

19:00.974 --> 19:02.351
The black hallway.

19:03.894 --> 19:06.521
I don't know if he knew where it leads,
but he thought it was important

19:06.522 --> 19:08.564
and they convinced you
to turn your back on him

19:08.565 --> 19:10.651
for some outie woman you don't even know.

19:13.320 --> 19:16.156
You know it's your fault
we're down here at all, right?

19:18.158 --> 19:19.535
No, it's not.

19:20.410 --> 19:22.119
And if we're so different from our outies,

19:22.120 --> 19:24.623
then how come we couldn't tell
when you were gone?

19:28.085 --> 19:29.086
Irving could.

19:32.422 --> 19:33.715
Mark couldn't.

19:40.347 --> 19:42.766
Sorry, I guess
I'm an asshole down here too.

20:42.910 --> 20:44.244
Hello, Mark.

20:47.497 --> 20:48.749
How are you?

20:51.835 --> 20:53.337
Oh, my God, so good.

20:54.046 --> 20:56.631
My wife's being held prisoner at Lumon

20:56.632 --> 20:59.842
and I just got brain surgery
in my basement.

20:59.843 --> 21:01.136
How have you been?

21:03.138 --> 21:04.931
We're allies now, there's no need to--

21:04.932 --> 21:07.099
We're allies now,
we're not neighbors anymore?

21:07.100 --> 21:09.685
- Sorry, I just... I guess I'm confused.
- Can you...

21:09.686 --> 21:11.312
This birthing cabin,
you can take us there, right?

21:11.313 --> 21:12.313
So we can talk to his innie.

21:12.314 --> 21:13.690
Not yet.

21:14.691 --> 21:17.193
Even under the cover of dark,
it's perilous.

21:17.194 --> 21:18.361
We wait for night.

21:18.362 --> 21:20.988
- It's perilous. Okay.
- Okay, yeah.

21:20.989 --> 21:22.698
You want us to wait until the evening?

21:22.699 --> 21:25.618
We don't even know
if he's completed the file yet.

21:25.619 --> 21:27.370
I assume no.

21:27.371 --> 21:28.830
What file?

21:40.425 --> 21:42.594
Cold Harbor.

21:47.391 --> 21:49.142
And if you've completed it...

21:51.311 --> 21:52.354
well...

22:00.404 --> 22:01.864
"Well" what?

22:05.659 --> 22:08.035
She's already dead.

22:08.036 --> 22:09.412
Jesus Christ.

22:09.413 --> 22:11.582
She better be fucking alive.

22:15.711 --> 22:18.629
- No! Fuck this. We're leaving. Right now.
- Hold on. Wait,

22:18.630 --> 22:20.131
- Mark-- Okay...
- I'm trying to help you.

22:20.132 --> 22:21.174
Mark.

22:21.175 --> 22:25.970
She is there and we are out here
in the middle of fucking nowhere.

22:25.971 --> 22:27.388
I know
and we're gonna get her out,

22:27.389 --> 22:29.516
but listen, that's what
we're doing here, right?

22:31.518 --> 22:32.852
Call Mr. Milchick.

22:32.853 --> 22:35.772
Tell him you're unwell
and won't be coming in today.

22:36.607 --> 22:37.649
Do it now.

22:40.777 --> 22:42.028
Oh, my God.

22:42.029 --> 22:45.324
If he smells chicanery,
he'll lock you out of the building.

22:46.366 --> 22:48.201
- How about fuck off? How about that?
- Wait.

22:48.202 --> 22:49.911
- I mean...
- Mark.

22:49.912 --> 22:51.787
- No, fuck that. No...
- Hold on. Stop. Don't go anywhere.

22:51.788 --> 22:52.997
- ...no fucking way.
- Mark, wait.

22:52.998 --> 22:54.248
- Listen to me.
- Absolutely not.

22:54.249 --> 22:57.502
- Do you have any idea how insane she is?
- Yes, I do.

22:57.503 --> 23:00.839
- Do you know what she did?
- Mark, listen to me.

23:01.673 --> 23:03.799
- Listen to me. Take a breath.
- No, I can't.

23:03.800 --> 23:05.009
- We can't do it.
- Mark,

23:05.010 --> 23:08.054
there is literally no other option than
to do what the fuck she says right now.

23:08.055 --> 23:09.640
For Gemma.

23:19.942 --> 23:21.610
She knows where she is, Mark.

23:55.227 --> 23:57.020
Okay, Irving.

24:38.353 --> 24:39.855
Fuck this place.

25:07.674 --> 25:09.717
I never hurt anyone.

25:09.718 --> 25:11.345
I want you to know that.

25:14.097 --> 25:17.351
I drove people places.

25:18.560 --> 25:21.563
I didn't ask what happened to them
once they get there.

25:30.697 --> 25:32.449
Is that what today is?

25:55.514 --> 26:00.561
I'm sure you know this is very
disappointing and reeks of ingratitude.

26:06.692 --> 26:07.733
Done.

26:07.734 --> 26:08.944
Anything else?

26:09.736 --> 26:11.029
Key card.

26:24.918 --> 26:28.088
Please report to the elevator and wait.

26:32.843 --> 26:34.553
I'm sorry, Dylan G.

26:39.057 --> 26:41.101
I should have facilitated better.

26:42.436 --> 26:44.188
That's enough.

26:48.734 --> 26:49.943
It's not your fault.

27:00.662 --> 27:03.415
So this is "tightening the leash"?

27:04.833 --> 27:09.087
Our most vital refiner
missing in the wind,

27:10.088 --> 27:12.925
on what was to be Lumon's finest day.

27:15.802 --> 27:17.221
This is your fault.

27:21.558 --> 27:24.561
I have followed protocol, Mr. Drummond,

27:25.979 --> 27:28.607
but I thank you for your remonstration.

27:30.067 --> 27:33.153
A needlessly complex
word for a simple idea.

27:36.490 --> 27:38.325
Apologize for the word.

27:41.161 --> 27:43.497
- Sir--
- Apologize for the word.

27:50.838 --> 27:52.339
I apologize.

27:53.590 --> 27:54.800
Shorter.

28:00.389 --> 28:01.598
I'm sorry.

28:02.182 --> 28:03.267
Again.

28:06.770 --> 28:07.855
Mr. Drummond...

28:09.439 --> 28:10.649
Again.

28:18.740 --> 28:20.492
Devour feculence.

28:25.497 --> 28:30.335
It means "eat shit," Mr. Drummond.

28:34.548 --> 28:39.386
- What did you just say to me?
- I am manager of the severed floor,

28:40.053 --> 28:41.889
which means two things.

28:42.598 --> 28:47.644
First, I am owed a measure of respect,
even by my superiors.

28:48.645 --> 28:54.902
Second, and more obvious, that said floor
comprises the whole of my jurisdiction.

28:56.528 --> 28:59.740
To put that monosyllabically,

29:01.074 --> 29:02.950
it's not my fault

29:02.951 --> 29:07.080
what Mark Scout does
when he is not at work.

29:08.957 --> 29:10.459
It's yours.

29:54.294 --> 29:56.296
Mr. Scout. Where are you?

29:59.925 --> 30:01.050
Well, I'm...

30:01.051 --> 30:04.262
I was worried about these nosebleeds.

30:04.263 --> 30:08.140
So we drove to this clinic
out in Soil Hill

30:08.141 --> 30:11.562
and, you know,
they want to do a few more tests.

30:14.731 --> 30:16.232
Let me send a car.

30:16.233 --> 30:18.234
You are a priority employee

30:18.235 --> 30:19.986
and you should be under Lumon care.

30:19.987 --> 30:21.989
May I get your exact location?

30:23.240 --> 30:24.408
I...

30:26.702 --> 30:27.995
Mr. Scout?

30:38.714 --> 30:40.257
I'm not sick.

30:43.719 --> 30:46.555
I just needed the day, okay?

30:50.684 --> 30:52.019
May I ask why?

30:55.731 --> 30:56.731
No.

30:56.732 --> 30:58.817
I've just got life stuff.

31:00.777 --> 31:02.738
Isn't that what Lumon's all about?

31:04.114 --> 31:05.115
Balance?

31:07.618 --> 31:09.912
I mean, work is just work, right?

31:12.915 --> 31:14.750
Do you know what I mean, Mr. Milchick?

31:32.851 --> 31:33.852
Mr. Milchick?

31:47.324 --> 31:50.244
I have your word
you report to work tomorrow?

31:55.249 --> 31:58.669
You do. Yeah, I'll be there. I promise.

31:59.711 --> 32:02.381
Good. And thank you for calling.

32:45.507 --> 32:46.549
Here you go, sir.

32:46.550 --> 32:47.676
Thanks.

32:59.980 --> 33:02.691
This line goes as far as you can go.

33:05.027 --> 33:06.778
I can't know where you get off.

33:07.362 --> 33:09.656
And you can never come back to Kier.

33:10.365 --> 33:11.575
Do you understand?

33:16.079 --> 33:17.080
No.

33:19.124 --> 33:21.335
Won't Lumon come after you?

33:28.967 --> 33:30.594
You asked me why I severed...

33:32.971 --> 33:38.142
I liked the idea that
I could be innocent again.

33:38.143 --> 33:39.268
Part of me.

33:39.269 --> 33:43.815
But then my innocent part
fell in love with you.

33:53.075 --> 33:54.451
I want to remember it.

33:57.538 --> 33:59.373
Probably better we don't.

34:03.001 --> 34:06.046
I've never been loved before.

34:07.089 --> 34:08.090
Not really.

34:09.341 --> 34:11.467
Well, now you have.

34:12.511 --> 34:13.512
How does it feel?

34:16.431 --> 34:18.100
I don't know. I...

34:21.143 --> 34:24.522
Don't you want to know how it felt?

34:24.523 --> 34:25.774
It's not possible.

34:28.235 --> 34:29.234
Burt...

34:29.235 --> 34:30.320
It's okay.

34:31.362 --> 34:32.697
Just go.

34:33.282 --> 34:34.908
I'm... I've never had this.

34:36.409 --> 34:38.660
- I know.
- My whole life.

34:38.661 --> 34:40.037
I know.

34:40.038 --> 34:41.123
I want to.

34:42.416 --> 34:43.500
I wanna have it.

34:45.168 --> 34:46.170
Irving.

34:48.547 --> 34:49.755
I'm ready.

34:56.179 --> 34:57.181
I'm ready.

35:04.938 --> 35:06.148
I'm ready.

35:10.819 --> 35:11.862
I'm ready.

35:13.405 --> 35:14.281
We can't.

35:14.823 --> 35:15.699
I'm ready.

35:17.534 --> 35:18.785
We can't.

35:21.121 --> 35:22.247
We can't!

35:41.308 --> 35:42.184
Bon voyage...

35:44.478 --> 35:45.395
buddy.

35:49.358 --> 35:50.567
Burt...

35:53.403 --> 35:54.238
bye.

39:37.336 --> 39:38.795
Left, left, right.

39:41.131 --> 39:45.551
Right, down the hall, right, right, left,
down the hall, left.

39:45.552 --> 39:49.056
Left, right, down, left... Fuck.

39:50.390 --> 39:52.058
Right,
all the way down the hallway,

39:52.059 --> 39:55.479
turn left, right,
left, down the hall, left.

39:56.438 --> 39:57.272
Fuck.

39:57.856 --> 40:01.943
Right, left, right down
the hallway, right,

40:01.944 --> 40:07.366
left, down the hallway,
left, left, left, right, left, left...

40:11.537 --> 40:12.704
You tricked me.

40:17.334 --> 40:18.752
My Helly.

40:22.548 --> 40:23.549
What the fuck?

40:53.745 --> 40:55.455
We're going to cottage five.

40:56.582 --> 40:58.166
I don't have anyone scheduled.

41:00.460 --> 41:02.461
She's one of Jame's.

41:02.462 --> 41:03.922
No one's to know.

41:13.682 --> 41:15.517
Miss Marsha White, ninth floor.

41:20.189 --> 41:21.773
Specialties Department.

41:24.026 --> 41:26.570
I'm looking for a gold thimble.

41:57.768 --> 41:58.936
Hi, Mark.

42:01.605 --> 42:04.733
- Wait. What?
- You're okay. You're fine.

42:06.860 --> 42:07.985
No, no.

42:07.986 --> 42:10.572
If you walk out that door,
he's just gonna come right back in again.

42:12.741 --> 42:14.451
- What is this?
- It's gonna be okay.

